{
  "embeddedAssets": {
    "assets": [
      {
        "dataBase64": "",
        "id": "sample.vfx-explosion.noiseMap",
        "mime": "image/png",
        "name": "fire-noise.png"
      }
    ],
    "bindings": {
      "noiseMap": "sample.vfx-explosion.noiseMap"
    }
  },
  "format": "kshader",
  "generator": "Kekenik Shader",
  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#60a5fa",
        "id": "note_inputs",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 73,
          "w": 456
        },
        "text": "Quad UV, normalised age (Age Percent stream), a per-particle random number (Stable Random stream), the particle colour and the screen UV for the haze."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_noise",
        "position": {
          "x": 682,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2378
        },
        "text": "The UV is rotated by `random + age × spin` turns. Layer A at the base tiling and layer B at 2.1× with an offset rising with age are blended 55 / 45: two interacting scales read as billowing. The raw samples are kept: they also drive the haze offset."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_body",
        "position": {
          "x": 682,
          "y": 1049
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2072
        },
        "text": "`body = saturate(noise × round × density)` with `round = 1 − smoothstep(0.1, 0.5, |uv − ½|)`. The threshold `age × erosion` rises over the life; `smoothstep(thr, thr + 0.25, body)` keeps what is above it."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fbbf24",
        "id": "note_heat",
        "position": {
          "x": 3264,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1766
        },
        "text": "`heat = saturate(body × (1 − age)^falloff)` indexes the shared **Color Ramp**: soot → flame → hot white. A young fireball is hot in its dense core; as it ages everything slides down the ramp towards soot."
      },
      {
        "color": "#f87171",
        "id": "note_haze",
        "position": {
          "x": 3264,
          "y": 735
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2072
        },
        "text": "`offset = (nA − ½, nB − ½) × distortion × round × (1 − age)`; the opaque scene is read at `screenUV + offset`. Haze alpha = `round × (1 − age) × haze`: the bent scene replaces the background around the fireball."
      },
      {
        "color": "#4ade80",
        "id": "note_alpha",
        "position": {
          "x": 5540,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1766
        },
        "text": "Fire alpha = erosion cut × soft depth fade × opacity × particle alpha. `colour = lerp(bent scene, fire colour, fire alpha)`, `alpha = max(fire alpha, haze alpha × particle alpha)`."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 7510,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Alpha blend, ZWrite off, two-sided."
      }
    ],
